ithms), F2 s32BE prefixes, strict reads, injected short/EINTR/zero-progress/error transfers, corrupt-open byte identity, idempotent close, no fd or native-memory leak, a full collection during a 1 GiB :blocking pwrite, missing/wrong-layout wrapper refused before guest work, exported-symbol allowlist (needs bb build:jolt-native)\\\"\\n   :task (System/exit\\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \\\"bb\\\" \\\"native/jolt-file/probes/run.clj\\\")))}\\n\\n  probe:jolt-udp\\n  {:doc \\\"J0b probe: raw nonblocking SOCK_DGRAM over jolt.ffi on macOS arm64 and Linux x86_64, printing the platform header first (needs bb bootstrap:jolt)\\\"\\n   :task (System/exit\\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \\\"sh\\\" \\\"src/dev/jolt_udp_probe.sh\\\")))}\\n\\n  probe:jolt-tcp\\n  {:doc \\\"J6d: the jolt TCP substrate and owner-thread pump (dao.stream.ws.tcp, dao.stream.ws.pump, driver sleep-fds!), one child jolt process per section: closure (no jolt.socket), address (literals/localhost, resolver trap), substrate (port 0, nonblocking accept/connect, EOF vs reset, gone-peer write survives), ordered (A3 short write, drain order, failure), fairness (A1 ii/iv), stdin (A1 i, held partial line), deadline (A2 seam), control (A3 event orders, A4 pong budget, D1 close slot), close (A5, D2, D3), listener (64 cap, lower-deadlines!, drained?); native memory and registry empty after close. Arguments select sections (needs bb bootstrap:jolt)\\\"\\n   :task (let [sections (or (seq *command-line-args*)\\n                            [\\\"closure\\\" \\\"address\\\" \\\"substrate\\\" \\\"ordered\\\" \\\"fairness\\\" \\\"stdin\\\"\\n                             \\\"deadline\\\" \\\"control\\\" \\\"close\\\" \\\"listener\\\"])\\n               results (mapv (fn [s]\\n                               (println \\\"== probe:jolt-tcp section\\\" s)\\n                               [s (:exit (shell {:continue true} \\\"sh\\\" \\\"-c\\\"\\n                                                \\\". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && exec \\\\\\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\\\\\" -Srepro -M:jolt src/dev/jolt_tcp_probe.clj \\\\\\\"$1\\\\\\\"\\\"\\n                                                \\\"jolt\\\" s))])\\n                             sections)]\\n           (println \\\"probe:jolt-tcp exits\\\" (pr-str results))\\n           (System/exit (if (every? (comp zero? second) results) 0 1)))}\\n\\n  probe:jolt-ws\\n  {:doc \\\"J6e: the jolt WebSocket host adapter (dao.stream.ws.jolt, the yin.repl.host shadow, the jolt -main wiring), one child jolt process per section: closure (C1), handshake (C2), bind (C3), address (C4), io (C5), close (C6), shutdown (C7, the real owner loop), isolation (C8), driver (C9, deadline folding, a --headless --port child), fairness (C10); native memory and registries empty after close. Arguments select sections (needs bb bootstrap:jolt and bb build:jolt-native)\\\"\\n   :task (let [sections (or (seq *command-line-args*)\\n                            [\\\"closure\\\" \\\"handshake\\\" \\\"bind\\\" \\\"address\\\" \\\"io\\\" \\\"close\\\" \\\"shutdown\\\"\\n                             \\\"isolation\\\" \\\"driver\\\" \\\"fairness\\\"])\\n               results (mapv (fn [s]\\n                               (println \\\"== probe:jolt-ws section\\\" s)\\n                               [s (:exit (shell {:continue true} \\\"sh\\\" \\\"-c\\\"\\n                                                \\\". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && exec \\\\\\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\\\\\" -Srepro -M:jolt src/dev/jolt_ws_probe.clj \\\\\\\"$1\\\\\\\"\\\"\\n                                                \\\"jolt\\\" s))])\\n                             sections)]\\n           (println \\\"probe:jolt-ws exits\\\" (pr-str results))\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\ncollab/yang-php/1794566777000-engineer-p7b-ticks-b.gpt-6.1-terra.stdout.log:22:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_10\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '37